OL,3,AMinister refuses to rule out some young
OL,4,Apeople may lose benefits after Milburn
OL,5,Areview
OL,6,
OL,7,FWork and Pensions Secretary Pat
OL,8,FMcFadden faces questions from Laura
OL,9,FKuenssberg ahead of the release of a
OL,10,Freport into young people not in
OL,11,Feducation, employment or training
OL,12,F(Neets) - watch live
OL,14,F"We need a complete reset of the system
OL,15,Fin terms of what it offers young
OL,16,Fpeople," McFadden says, adding:
OL,17,F"Benefits are not guaranteed for life"
OL,19,FIt comes after the report's author,
OL,20,FAlan Milburn, called for a legal
OL,21,Fguarantee of a job or training for
OL,22,Fyoung people
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
