OL,3,AMinister refuses to rule out some young
OL,4,Apeople may lose benefits after Milburn
OL,5,Areview
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a pre-recorded interview broadcast
OL,8,Fon today's show, Milburn says it's
OL,9,Fimportant to be "candid with people"
OL,10,Fthat under his proposals it would take
OL,11,F10 years for the benefits bill to come
OL,12,Fdown
OL,14,FAlso facing questions this week is
OL,15,Fshadow work and pensions secretary
OL,16,FHelen Whately
